direction: right
question: User question
router: Intent router
single_shot: Single-shot RAG
agent: Retrieval agent
search_tool: search_knowledge_base
generator: Generator
grounding_check: Grounding check
answer: Cited answer
fallback: Fallback
question -> router: classify intent
router -> single_shot: simple lookup
router -> agent: multi-hop
agent -> search_tool: tool call
search_tool -> agent: chunks
agent -> agent: rewrite query
agent -> generator: enough context
generator -> grounding_check: draft + citations
grounding_check -> answer: grounded
grounding_check -> fallback: confidence below 40%
